    "services_btn": "Start today",
    "services_desc": "We are not a rigid school. We are a daily habit. Select the tier that matches your budget and commitment. Start today, speak tomorrow. WHAT ARE YOU WAITING FOR?",
    "services_eyebrow": "OUR SERVICES",
    "home_groups_title": "Choose the size of your group",
    "home_groups_desc": "Every plan has live classes with a teacher on fixed days every week. The smaller the group, the more time you have to speak.",
    "home_groups_people": "people in your group",
    "home_groups_private": "just you and your teacher",
    "home_groups_month": "a month",
    "home_groups_1_desc": "One live class a week in a group of about 35 people, with access to the community.",
    "home_groups_2_desc": "Two live classes a week in a group of about 17 people, with feedback on your work every week.",
    "home_groups_3_desc": "Three live classes a week in a group of about 6 people, plus a one-to-one session every week.",
    "home_groups_4_desc": "Private classes with your teacher, based on three classes a week, with extra classes available.",
    "home_groups_cta": "Compare the plans",
    "home_langs_title": "Language courses",
    "home_langs_desc": "Live classes with a teacher, from A1 to C2, with practice between classes. Choose your language to see how the course works, its levels, the certificates you can prepare for and the prices.",
    "home_seo_title": "Learn a language online with a live teacher",
    "home_seo_intro": "Alimun is an online language school where every course is built around live classes with a teacher. Here is how it works and what to expect.",
    "home_seo_1_h": "Live online classes, not recorded videos",
    "home_seo_1_p": "Every class is a live video lesson with a teacher and <span class=\"sx_mark\">the same group of learners</span>, on fixed days at the same time each week. You speak from the first lesson, your teacher corrects you as you go, and after each class you get the session notes, the new vocabulary and your homework.",
    "home_seo_2_h": "Practice between classes",
    "home_seo_2_p": "Between lessons you keep practicing with <span class=\"sx_mark\">exercises at your level that are corrected instantly</span>, flashcards with the vocabulary from class and tasks in exam format. Your teacher sets the homework and returns it corrected, with a grade, your strengths and what to improve.",
    "home_seo_3_h": "Group classes at a fair price",
    "home_seo_3_p": "In a group, <span class=\"sx_mark\">the cost of each class is shared</span>, so live teaching costs far less than private tutoring. You choose how much attention you want: groups of about 35, 17 or 6 people, or private one-to-one classes, from €24 a month.",
    "home_seo_4_h": "Every level from A1 to C2",
    "home_seo_4_p": "Courses follow the Common European Framework of Reference, from beginner to proficient. A short placement test <span class=\"sx_mark\">puts you in the right group</span> between A1 and C1, so you do not repeat what you already know. You can also practice tasks in the format of B2 First, C1 Advanced and IELTS for English, and Goethe B1, Goethe B2 and telc B1 for German.",
    "home_seo_5_h": "English and German now, more languages soon",
    "home_seo_5_p": "English and German classes are open today. French, Spanish, Italian and Portuguese are coming, and you can <span class=\"sx_mark\">join their waitlist for free</span> to hear when they open. All you need is a computer or other device with a camera and a microphone: classes run in the browser and you can cancel at any time.",
    "home_quiz_btn": "Find out your level",
    "home_quiz_pick": "Choose the language you want to test. It takes about two minutes, and the sentences get harder as you answer correctly.",
    "footer_legal_title": "Legal",
    "tiers_plans_title": "Plans and prices",
    "tiers_plans_desc": "Every plan has live classes with a teacher on fixed days every week, practice with instant feedback and homework corrected by your teacher. The smaller the group, the more time you have to speak.",
    "tiers_bill_monthly": "Monthly",
    "tiers_bill_yearly": "Yearly",
    "tiers_bill_note": "With the yearly plan you pay for ten months instead of twelve.",
    "tiers_billed_yearly": "{price} billed once a year",
    "tiers_billed_monthly": "Billed every month",
    "tiers_per_month": "a month",
    "tiers_size_1": "About 35 people per group",
    "tiers_size_2": "About 17 people per group",
    "tiers_size_3": "About 6 people per group, plus a weekly one-to-one",
    "tiers_size_4": "Private, just you and your teacher",
    "tiers_plan_1_desc": "One live class a week, session notes with the new vocabulary, and access to the community.",
    "tiers_plan_2_desc": "Two live classes a week in a smaller group, feedback on your work every week, essay feedback and a monthly progress report.",
    "tiers_plan_3_desc": "Three live classes a week in a near-private group, a one-to-one session every week and a learning path made for you.",
    "tiers_plan_4_desc": "Private classes with your own teacher, based on three classes a week, a curriculum built around you and extra classes when you need them.",
    "tiers_choose": "Choose this plan",
    "tiers_hero_lead": "Live language classes with a teacher, from €24 a month. Choose the size of your group and how often you meet, and switch plan as your goals change.",
    "tiers_hero_cta": "See the plans",
    "tiers_pc_title": "What a live class costs",
    "tiers_pc_desc": "Pick a plan to see the price of one live class, worked out from its monthly price and the classes you get in a month of about 4.3 weeks.",
    "tiers_pc_unit": "per live class",
    "tiers_pc_line_1": "One live class a week, about 4 a month, for {price} a month.",
    "tiers_pc_line_2": "Two live classes a week, about 9 a month, for {price} a month.",
    "tiers_pc_line_3": "Three group classes and one one-to-one session a week, about 17 a month, for {price} a month.",
    "tiers_pc_line_4": "Three private classes a week, about 13 a month, for {price} a month.",
    "tiers_pc_year": "On the yearly plan: about {price} per class.",
    "tiers_faq_title": "Questions about plans and prices",
    "tiers_faq_q1": "Can I cancel at any time?",
    "tiers_faq_a1": "Yes. You can cancel at any time in the billing settings of your account, and you keep access until the end of the period you have paid for, as set out in the Terms and Conditions.",
    "tiers_faq_q2": "How does the yearly plan work?",
    "tiers_faq_a2": "You pay once a year and get twelve months for the price of ten. Community, for example, costs €240 a year instead of €24 every month.",
    "tiers_faq_q3": "Can I change plan later?",
    "tiers_faq_a3": "Yes. You can move to another plan as your goals change. If you need help choosing, write to us through the contact page.",
    "tiers_faq_q4": "In which currency do I pay?",
    "tiers_faq_a4": "Prices are shown in your currency where we can, in euros, US dollars, Canadian dollars, Australian dollars or Moroccan dirhams, and you pay in the currency shown on the page.",
    "tiers_faq_q5": "What if my language is not open yet?",
    "tiers_faq_a5": "You can join its waitlist for free and pay nothing today. We email you as soon as classes in your language open, and English and German classes are already open.",
    "services_hero_title_v2": "Online language classes",
    "services_hero_desc_v2": "Live video classes with your teacher and the same group, on fixed days every week. Between classes, exercises and tests are corrected the moment you answer, and your teacher corrects your homework.",
    "services_btn_how": "See how it works",
    "services_tools_title": "Practice between classes",
    "services_tools_desc": "Between live classes you keep going on your own. Exercises and tests are corrected the moment you answer, and your teacher corrects your homework.",
    "services_title": "Your Path to Fluency: Choose Your Access.",
