    "about_hero_title": "Our story",
    "about_hero_desc": "Built by language teachers who got tired of watching great students stall out in expensive, infrequent 1:1 lessons. Alimun pairs regular live classes with practice that gives instant feedback, so progress happens between classes too, not just during them.",
    "about_btn_waitlist": "Join the waitlist",
    "about_history_title": "A Standard for Real Fluency",
    "about_history_desc": "Built since day one around one idea: a great teacher can guide many students at once if the AI handles the repetitive grading. That belief shapes every tier, every class, and every feature we ship.",
