    "about_staff_1_desc": "With 18 years of teaching, Sarah designs the curriculum behind our Community tier — built so total beginners build a real habit from week one.",
    "about_staff_2_desc": "Jessica brings 22 years of classroom experience, specializing in turning hesitant intermediate speakers into confident, fluent conversationalists.",
    "about_staff_3_desc": "A linguist with 15 years of teaching experience, Martina leads our Micro-Group sessions, known for catching the small mistakes that hold learners back.",
    "about_staff_4_desc": "With 20 years of experience, Kevin leads our Intensive 1:1 program, favored by learners who want a fully custom plan and weekly accountability.",
